# Bulk archive seeds: one record per line, deliberately.
#
# These hold tens of thousands of rows and are machine output, not files anyone
# edits. Pretty-printing them triples their size and turns every diff into
# hundreds of thousands of lines, which hides the change rather than showing it.
src/database/seeds/boot/press-archive-*.json

# The world panel, on the same terms and for the same reason: 33 MB of
# collector output across twenty-five files, each a single line. See ADR 0024.
src/database/seeds/boot/worldbank-panel/*.json
